## conclusion
- The documented install path (render.yaml/Dockerfile/CI: pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.lock) FAILS on arm64 as the lock stands.
- Running R-177 on Oracle A1 (or AWS c7g) needs a reviewed lock change adding aarch64 hashes for cryptography and cffi (same versions, hashes from PyPI) — a supply-chain change, NOT made in this batch; or an x86 host.
- Oracle E2.1.Micro is x86 but 1/8 OCPU + 1GB: unsuitable as SUT or generator.
